  "language_raw": "English",
  "source": "message/dat/English/script/class_g_01.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/English/script/class_g_01.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_01",
      "hash64": "1BD8F6B3555A4841",
      "text": "I see we have some energetic young ones in our\\nclass this time around.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_02",
      "hash64": "1BD8F3B3555A4328",
      "text": "You may call me Mr. Saguaro.\\c\\nYour time here with me will be spent obtaining\\nknowledge and skills indispensable for daily life.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_03",
      "hash64": "1BD8F4B3555A44DB",
      "text": "Many of you have left the care of your parents to\\nlive here on your own in the academy dormitory.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_04",
      "hash64": "1BD8F9B3555A4D5A",
      "text": "I pray that the knowledge I impart to you will\\nimprove the quality of your lives and the\\r\\nnecessities thereof—food, clothing, and shelter.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_05",
      "hash64": "1BD8FAB3555A4F0D",
      "text": "Of those three categories, I assume the most\\npressing and interesting for you all is food.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_06",
      "hash64": "1BD8F7B3555A49F4",
      "text": "When you eat sandwiches on your picnics, the HP\\nof your party Pokémon will be restored.\\c\\nYou will also gain something called [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Meal Powers[VAR 0xFF00(0000)],\\nwhich can provide all manner of benefits.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 189,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_07",
      "hash64": "1BD8F8B3555A4BA7",
      "text": "For example, these powers can make Pokémon\\neasier to catch or increase the Exp. Points that\\r\\nyour Pokémon receive.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_08",
      "hash64": "1BD8EDB3555A38F6",
      "text": "I think you will also find that the breadth of these\\neffects can be expanded by crafting sandwiches\\r\\nof superb flavor.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_09",
      "hash64": "1BD8EEB3555A3AA9",
      "text": "What’s more, there is a certain something that is\\nparticularly important if we wish to receive Meal\\r\\nPowers with even more helpful effects.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_10",
      "hash64": "1BDBFBB3555C8697",
      "text": "Let me see... M[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0305)]asteriss [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\c\\nTell me—what must you keep in mind to receive\\neven more helpful Meal Powers?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0305"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_g_01_select_01",
      "hash64": "1B0AA1358C89B85C",
      "text": "My choice of fillings and condiments",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_g_01_select_02",
      "hash64": "1B0AA4358C89BD75",
      "text": "How fast I can prepare the food",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_g_01_select_03",
      "hash64": "1B0AA3358C89BBC2",
      "text": "I have to remember to put my heart into it!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_answer_01",
      "hash64": "044A470EB5724ACA",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Perfectly correct, M[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0305)]asteriss\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\c\\nPerhaps you were already aware of this fact from\\nhaving helped your family with cooking at home?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0305"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_answer_02",
      "hash64": "044A460EB5724917",
      "text": "That is...incorrect. I pray that you all put more\\nemphasis on doing things well when cooking\\r\\nrather than simply rushing to finish quickly.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_answer_03",
      "hash64": "044A450EB5724764",
      "text": "Ha! That is an interesting take. Though not\\nexactly what I was looking for, I suppose you are\\r\\ncorrect, in a sense.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_11",
      "hash64": "1BDBFAB3555C84E4",
      "text": "Your choice of ingredients—including both fillings\\nand condiments—is an important factor in gaining\\r\\neven more helpful Meal Powers.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_12",
      "hash64": "1BDBFDB3555C89FD",
      "text": "For example, using sweet ingredients in your\\nsandwiches may help you gain Egg Power.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_13",
      "hash64": "1BDBFCB3555C884A",
      "text": "Including numerous bitter ingredients, on the\\nother hand, can gain you Item Drop Power.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_14",
      "hash64": "1BDBF7B3555C7FCB",
      "text": "Learning to aim for specific effects when crafting\\nsandwiches will almost certainly make your\\r\\nculinary endeavors more enjoyable.\\c\\nPlease be aware, however, that you can also\\nreceive Meal Powers by eating at restaurants.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 224,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_15",
      "hash64": "1BDBF6B3555C7E18",
      "text": "I must say that I would feel the utmost joy if you\\nall learned much here in my class and came to\\r\\nbetter understand home economics.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_16",
      "hash64": "1BDBF9B3555C8331",
      "text": "Our time together has come to an end for today.\\nI bid you all farewell.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
